WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:15.253
must get to the construction site," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:18.675
"I have to find out what's causing the sinkholes!"

3
00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:21.997
She called over to her friends.

4
00:00:22.017 --> 00:00:23.318
"Hey, guys!

5
00:00:24.179 --> 00:00:24.859
I'll be back.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.862
I, um, forgot my shin guards!"

7
00:00:29.923 --> 00:00:31.404
She hurried away from the soccer field.

8
00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:33.864
"But you don't need them!"

9
00:00:34.084 --> 00:00:35.065
Terrell called after her.

10
00:00:35.085 --> 00:00:37.605
"We're not having soccer practice!"

11
00:00:38.806 --> 00:00:39.986
Roxy was already gone.

12
00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:43.347
A second later Rocket Girl flashed through the sky.

13
00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:45.627
"Look!" cried Mara.

14
00:00:46.328 --> 00:00:47.628
"It's Rocket Girl!"

15
00:00:51.409 --> 00:00:52.849
Roxy flew over Metro City.

16
00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:55.330
She saw large holes everywhere.

17
00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:57.831
They looked like giant gopher holes.

18
00:01:00.251 --> 00:01:02.512
She spotted Detective Smith at the construction site.

19
00:01:03.724 --> 00:01:05.145
He was talking to two workers.

20
00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:08.387
Nearby stood a building that wasn't yet finished.

21
00:01:09.287 --> 00:01:11.508
The entire site was filled with large holes.

22
00:01:12.929 --> 00:01:14.610
Roxy landed next to the detective.

23
00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:17.211
"What's going on here, Detective?"

24
00:01:17.471 --> 00:01:18.372
she asked with a grin.

25
00:01:18.392 --> 00:01:21.354
"Are you digging for treasure?"

26
00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:24.015
Detective Smith frowned.

27
00:01:24.035 --> 00:01:27.097
"That's not funny, Rocket Girl.

28
00:01:27.917 --> 00:01:30.618
Something very strange is happening in Metro City."

29
00:01:30.638 --> 00:01:33.160
"I know," said Roxy.

30
00:01:33.952 --> 00:01:35.854
"Big sinkholes are everywhere.

31
00:01:36.614 --> 00:01:38.296
Does anyone know what caused them?"

32
00:01:39.417 --> 00:01:41.839
"We have no idea," said the detective.

33
00:01:41.859 --> 00:01:44.661
"But we need to find out right away.

34
00:01:45.602 --> 00:01:47.723
Things are disappearing into the holes!"

35
00:01:47.743 --> 00:01:52.167
"All the vehicles from this construction site are missing, right?"

36
00:01:52.407 --> 00:01:53.028
said Roxy.

37
00:01:53.048 --> 00:01:55.249
"Yep," said one of the workers.

38
00:01:55.269 --> 00:01:58.732
"Every dump truck, crane, and bulldozer!"

39
00:01:58.752 --> 00:02:02.996
"My car is gone too," said the other worker.

40
00:02:03.784 --> 00:02:04.584
She looked frightened.

41
00:02:04.604 --> 00:02:08.446
"It just sank into the ground!"

42
00:02:09.386 --> 00:02:11.167
She pointed to a big hole nearby.

43
00:02:11.187 --> 00:02:13.428
"Did you see it happen?"

44
00:02:13.688 --> 00:02:14.589
asked Detective Smith.

45
00:02:15.529 --> 00:02:16.389
The worker nodded.

46
00:02:16.409 --> 00:02:19.091
"First there was a loud rumble.

47
00:02:19.771 --> 00:02:20.831
The ground shook.

48
00:02:21.552 --> 00:02:23.432
It felt like a small earthquake.

49
00:02:24.553 --> 00:02:28.415
Then the hole appeared, and my car sank right into it!"

50
00:02:29.475 --> 00:02:31.596
Suddenly—rumble, rumble!

51
00:02:32.416 --> 00:02:33.716
The ground shook violently.

52
00:02:35.177 --> 00:02:36.637
"Oh no!"

53
00:02:36.917 --> 00:02:37.858
cried Detective Smith.

54
00:02:37.878 --> 00:02:40.798
"It's an earthquake!"

55
00:02:41.719 --> 00:02:42.659
The building wobbled.

56
00:02:43.559 --> 00:02:45.120
A big piece of steel fell from it.

57
00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.660
"Look out!"

58
00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:48.621
Roxy cried.

59
00:02:49.621 --> 00:02:51.881
Detective Smith and the workers ran out of the way.

60
00:02:52.962 --> 00:02:54.962
Roxy flew up and caught the piece of steel.

61
00:02:58.923 --> 00:03:00.864
she said as she laid it safely on the ground.

62
00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:03.197
"Rocket Girl!"

63
00:03:03.377 --> 00:03:05.199
Detective Smith called over the loud rumble.

64
00:03:05.219 --> 00:03:08.042
"What do you think is causing this earthquake?"

65
00:03:08.062 --> 00:03:09.844
"I don't know!"

66
00:03:10.084 --> 00:03:10.925
Roxy called back.

67
00:03:10.945 --> 00:03:16.271
"But we need to find out Roxy stopped talking.

68
00:03:17.272 --> 00:03:19.414
Her super ears were picking up a new sound.

